      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "気付いたらお布団もパジャマも動物柄！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "回过神来，被褥和睡衣都已经变成动物图案了！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Before I knew it, my futon and pajamas both have animal prints!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_100APPLE_IMG_0092.JPG",
